### Notes
#
# API Versioning: All endpoints use v1 by default (/api/v1/...)
#
# Authentication:
# - Most endpoints require JWT authentication via Bearer token
# - Register a user first, then login to get JWT and refresh tokens
# - Update jwt_token and refresh_token variables after login
#
# Docker URLs:
# - API: http://localhost:8080
# - Database: localhost:5432
# - pgAdmin: http://localhost:5050 (login: admin at admin.com / admin)
#
# Local Development URLs:
# - HTTP: http://localhost:5242
# - HTTPS: https://localhost:7095
# - Swagger: http://localhost:5242/swagger (Development only)
#
# Pagination:
# - Address endpoint supports pagination with ?page=1&perPage=10 (or pageSize=10)
# - Returns Laravel-compatible format with data, links, and meta
# - Optional sorting: ?sortBy=city&desc=true (or updatedat, isprimary)
#
# Address Management:
# - Many-to-many relationship: addresses can be shared between users
# - Each user has independent isPrimary flag for their addresses
# - Setting isPrimary=true auto-resets other addresses for that user
# - Database uses Laravel naming convention: address_user pivot table
#
# Address Types (Updated to Ukrainian):
# - ID 1: "Квартира" (Багатоквартирний будинок у місті)
# - ID 2: "Приватний будинок" (Окрема садиба або дача)
# - ID 3: "Офіс" (Комерційне або офісне приміщення)
#
# Regions:
# - 26 Ukrainian regions available (області України)
# - Use GET /api/v1/region to get full list with IDs
#
# CORS:
# - Configured to allow origins from environment variable
# - Docker: allows all origins (*)
# - Local: configure in .env file

###
